    name: '2025 High Noon Concert Series',
    title: '2025 High Noon Concert Series',
    description:
      'The High Noon Concert Series is a cherished summer tradition in Lubbock, Texas, featuring free live music by local artists every Wednesday from 12:00 p.m. to 1:00 p.m. The concerts take place at the Lubbock County Courthouse Gazebo and lawn, located at 904 Broadway, and run from early June through early August. Attendees can enjoy a variety of food trucks on-site and have a chance to win one of two $50 cash prizes during each concert, with one ticket per person and winners required to be present.',
