    timezone: 'CDT',
    description:
      '<div class="xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs">Get ready for an unforgettable evening of music, laughter, and award-winning wine at our Dueling Pianos Night! Listening to two pianos dueling is an electrifying and immersive experience, filled with energy, spontaneity, and musical brilliance. The moment the first notes strike, you’re drawn into a lively back-and-forth musical battle, where the pianists challenge each other with fast-paced melodies, unexpected twists, and playful improvisation.</div> \r\n <div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s">Gather your friends and sing along to an electrifying night of entertainment. Whether you’re celebrating a special occasion or just looking for a fun night out, this event is one you won’t want to miss!<br class="html-br"> <div class="x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n xd10rxx x1sy0etr x17r0tee x972fbf xcfux6l x1qhh985 xm0m39n x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj xzsf02u x1s688f" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> \r\n </div> \r\n ',
